{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\"better\":\"Y\",\"nets\":{\"big\":\"Y\",\"small\":\"Y\",\"core\":\"X\",\"concise\":\"X\",\"human\":\"Y\",\"fine\":\"X\",\"load\":\"Y\"},\"why\":\"big：Y的高亮词直接呈现每屏的心理转折，单看大字更容易串出怀念、不甘、犹疑到带着想念继续往前的过程；X的大字更多在交代事件，主要情绪需要依赖小字补足。small：Y的小字能补全因果、转念和情绪变化，整体衔接较紧；X有些感受比喻与当屏具体行动联系较松。core：X更好，拒绝额外工作、谈清相处界限、安排自己的生活等具体行动，与旧饭桌、旧菜单、旧友等归属记忆交替出现，更完整地呈现了尊严与怀念的拉扯。concise：X的事件逐屏推进，新增信息较多；Y多次回到想念、孤单、是否回去的问题，部分屏幕在重复相近的内心判断。human：Y整体表达更接近日常说话；X有“换了副热闹步子”“心脏以最高负荷”等搭配生硬或偏技术化的表达。fine：X更胜在感受的具体性，如胸口发紧、伸手只摸到空处、腿脚发虚等，更多是在写观众的身体和心理体验；Y有不少感受实际在描述和弦、旋律及音乐走向。load：Y的大字词组更短，X在S10、S11等短停留屏幕仍有多个较长的大块，扫读负担更重。整体选Y，主要优势是心理主线更容易直接读出，且大字负担较轻；X的具体行动叙事和感受描写则更有优势。\"}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "6c0f1ea2-95c1-4d0e-95b1-6e421a297b20", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261111T162507356887Z", "elapsed_seconds": 373.359, "completed_utc": "2026-11-11T16:31:20.725798+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "1de01414c9c1d5d1ddf7099362ec5d7cac359ef473be95378e92b54bfad36106", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py"